 xlink:href="jcellbiol_jcb.200603176_6.html"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="video" mime-subtype="quicktime" xlink:href="jcellbiol_175_1_jcb.200603176__JCB200603176.V1.mov"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="text" mime-subtype="html" xlink:href="jcellbiol_jcb.200603176_7.html"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="video" mime-subtype="quicktime" xlink:href="jcellbiol_175_1_jcb.200603176__JCB200603176.V2.mov"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="text" mime-subtype="html" xlink:href="jcellbiol_jcb.200603176_8.html"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="video" mime-subtype="quicktime" xlink:href="jcellbiol_175_1_jcb.200603176__JCB200603176.V3.mov"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="text" mime-subtype="html" xlink:href="jcellbiol_jcb.200603176_9.html"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="video" mime-subtype="quicktime" xlink:href="jcellbiol_175_1_jcb.200603176__JCB200603176.V4.mov"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="text" mime-subtype="html" xlink:href="jcellbiol_jcb.200603176_10.html"/><media xlink:role="associated-file" mimetype="video" mime-subtype="quicktime" xlink:href="jcellbiol_175_1_jcb.200603176__JCB200603176.V5.mov"/></supplementary-material></sec></body><back><ack><p>We would like to thank Dr. Bert Vogelstein for providing the pAdEasy adenoviral vector system, Dr. Roger Tsien for providing the mRFP vector, Dr. Gail Martin for help with lentiviral construction of an mRFP-containing construct, and Dr. Ann Ellis for expert technical assistance with plastic sections.</p><p>This work was supported by National Institutes of Health grants HL 59373 and HL 79460 to G.E. Davis.</p></ack><ref-list><ref id="bib1"><citation citation-type="journal">Anand-Apte, B., M.S. Pepper, E. Voest, R. Montesano, B. Olsen, G. Murphy, S.S. Apte, and B. Zetter. <year>1997</year>. Inhibition of angiogenesis by tissue inhibitor of metalloproteinase-3. <source>Invest. Ophthalmol. Vis. Sci.</source> <vol